      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Ahmednagar</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When arranging <strong>Bike Transport From Ahmednagar To Mumbai</strong>, meticulous documentation is the single most critical factor in ensuring a seamless, legally compliant, and secure transit process. While the distance between these two major hubs is manageable, the complexity of urban traffic and interstate logistics demands strict adherence to regulatory standards.</p>
<p>Failure to present the correct paperwork can result in significant delays, seizure of goods, or denial of insurance claims. Therefore, shippers must prepare a comprehensive document set before handing over the vehicle to the logistics provider.</p>

<p>The foundation of any legitimate bike shipment rests on the <strong>self-attested RC photocopy</strong>. This document verifies the legal ownership of the two-wheeler. It is imperative that the name on the Registration Certificate matches the name of the shipper exactly. Discrepancies in ownership details can lead to immediate rejection by transport authorities.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Alongside the RC, you must submit the <strong>current PUC (Pollution Under Control) certificate</strong>.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Although the vehicle is being transported rather than driven, many logistics partners and police check points require proof that the vehicle was roadworthy at the time of picking up.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>An expired PUC can cause unnecessary friction during the transit process, so ensure this certificate is valid for the entirety of the journey.</span></li></ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Equally vital is the <strong>valid insurance certificate</strong>.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This document must be active on the date of dispatch.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>While your personal comprehensive or third-party insurance covers accidents on the road, it does not automatically cover damage that occurs while the bike is inside a transport truck or during loading and unloading.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>To bridge this gap, you must obtain an <strong>IBA-approved consignment bilty</strong>.</span></li></ul>
<p>This is the official invoice and bill of lading issued by the logistics company. It serves as the contract of carriage, detailing the contents, weight, and destination of the shipment. Without a properly filled and signed bilty, the transport company assumes no liability for the goods.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">For maximum financial protection, it is strongly advised to highlight the inclusion of <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Standard transport policies often have a liability cap of ₹50,000 per consignment, which is insufficient for high-value motorcycles.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Marine transit insurance, however, covers the full agreed-upon value of your bike against risks such as theft, fire, water damage, and accidental breakage during transit.</span></li></ul>
<p>By opting for this 100% coverage, you ensure that if any mishap occurs between Ahmednagar and Mumbai, you receive compensation equal to the market value of your vehicle, rather than a nominal sum. This layer of protection transforms a standard shipment into a fully secured service.</p>

